{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1261999-poll-favorite-1e-kiths","id":1261999,"title":"Poll: Favorite 1e kiths?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-21T14:44:19-07:00","id":1261999,"title":"Poll: Favorite 1e kiths?","content":"Hi all - I'm taking a poll: What are your favorite 1e kiths that you'd like to see updated to 2e?<br /> <br /> NOTE: this is <b>not</b> any kind of promise that the ones with the most votes will get updated, or anything like that. I just want to get a sense.<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-21T14:51:34-07:00","id":1262000,"title":"","content":"<b>Antiquarians </b>were always my favourite Darklings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A